  "bio": "Discover the artistry of ink at Sands Of Time Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Limerick, Ireland. Specializing in black & gray, geometric, and fineline designs, our team of highly skilled artists, including Paul Bullman, Stewart O' Keeffe, Paddy Dundon, and piercing expert Robbie Benn, are dedicated to crafting timeless tattoos in a welcoming and creative environment. Indulge in a unique experience where precision meets craftsmanship at the hands of our diverse artists, including the talented Rose Nicole and the enigmatic creator behind Bittersweet Tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Limerick, Ireland"
